        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joakim Nyström, Kimberly Po-Messerli, Lori McNeil, Amy Frazier, Katie Schlukebir\n- Events: 1999 Challenge Bell – Doubles\n- Places: Sweden, United States\n- Roles: tennis players, defending champions\n\nFacts:\n- Joakim \"Jocke\" Nyström was born on 20 February 1963 and is a former top ten ranked tennis player from Sweden.\n- Kimberly Po-Messerli was born on October 20, 1971 and is a former professional tennis player from the United States.\n- Joakim Nyström won 13 singles titles during his professional tennis career.\n- At the 1999 Challenge Bell – Doubles event, defending champions Lori McNeil and Kimberly Po lost in the quarterfinals to Amy Frazier and Katie Schlukebir.",
